  <item>
    <title>如何建立系统的长期学习能力？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a3bb01d9d2f5743683d3095</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a3bb01d9d2f5743683d3095</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 10:28:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> 献给每一个曾经像我一样被考试折磨到怀疑人生的东亚小孩</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> 从小被教育在强压下撑住顶住，克服万难，但很少有人会教我们如何建立系统的长期学习能力</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a> 脑子快、记得牢，自律，刷题多的悖论</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 建立放松安全的环境</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="314">05:14</a> 建立正向的自我评价系统</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a>不断的进步的成长型思维</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">08:26</a> 高敏感小孩：学习=恐惧</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 拆解最小学习单位</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 大脑害怕巨大且没有边界的任务</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a>最小的产出</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a> 闭环越积累的越多，我们的整个学习系统它就会越稳定</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> 背包旅行发现新世界</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a>允许自己犯错，允许自己不会，允许自己学得比较慢</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a> 冥想是如何提高长期系统学习能力？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1601">26:41</a> 情绪更加稳定，注意力自如地收回来，自我评价也会更温柔</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a>马友友练琴的诀窍</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1816">30:16</a> 微小的进步</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">31:58</a> 把注意力拉回来</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1970">32:50</a> 刷手机的冲动越来越小</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2091">34:51</a> 人总有状态不好的时候。它并不等同于我这个人就不行。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2151">35:51</a>提高恢复能力 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2203">36:43</a> 日常清空缓存</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2359">39:19</a>在意结果还是学习的过程？</span><br></p>]]></description>
